    specs: "20 x 55 in. running area · 0.5–10 mph · 10% power incline · 300 lb capacity (Horizon) · folds · lifetime frame and motor warranty",
    pros: [
      "A 20 by 55-inch running area, the longest-and-widest combination at this price",
      "Lifetime frame and motor warranty, stated on both the Amazon listing and Horizon’s site",
      "Dial controls and one-touch keys for speed and incline changes mid-interval",
      "Bluetooth to apps including Zwift and Peloton, with separate subscriptions required",
