    tags: [
      "best low cost treadmill for running",
      "best running machine under 500",
      "best treadmill for runners on a budget",
      "budget running treadmill",
      "cheap treadmill for running",
      "10 mph treadmill",
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{ text: "Best Overall: Horizon T101 Connect", link: PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl }}
>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/best/">Best Treadmills</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Buying Guide</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Best Budget Treadmills for Running</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        The best low-cost treadmill for running is the Horizon T101 Connect: a 20 by 55-inch running area, 10 mph and a lifetime motor warranty for about $777 on Amazon. Under $800 there are only a handful of machines you can genuinely run on; here are six, and why most cheap treadmills are walking machines.
      </p>
      <p class="ed-answer"><strong>Short answer.</strong> Best Overall: <a href="#horizon-t101-connect">Horizon T101 Connect</a>. Best Budget: <a href="#sunny-auto-incline-treadmill">Sunny Health & Fitness Auto Incline Treadmill</a>. Best for Speed Work: <a href="#therun-20-auto-incline">THERUN 20% Auto Incline Treadmill</a>.</p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated November 28, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS<br />
          <span class="ed-method">How we chose: makers’ published specifications and manuals, independent reviews and owner reports, cross-checked. Not tested hands-on.</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#top-picks" class="btn-ghost">View products</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        We may earn a commission when you buy through the links below. It costs you nothing and never decides a ranking. <a href="/editorial-standards/">How we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#horizon-t101-connect"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31pAWKay09L._SL500_.jpg" alt="Horizon T101 Connect" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#sunny-auto-incline-treadmill"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4132OQswF8L._SL500_.jpg" alt="Sunny Health &amp; Fitness Auto Incline Treadmill" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#therun-20-auto-incline"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YnGG85+YL._SL500_.jpg" alt="THERUN 20% Auto Incline Treadmill" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Horizon T101 Connect · Sunny Health &amp; Fitness Auto Incline Treadmill · THERUN 20% Auto Incline Treadmill</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          A budget treadmill you can actually run on needs three things most cheap machines leave
          out: a belt at least 20 inches wide and 50 to 55 inches long, a top speed of 10 mph, and a
          frame and motor built for the pounding of a running stride rather than a walk. Below about
          $500, almost everything on Amazon fails at least one of those tests, however the listing
          is worded. Between $550 and $800 a small group passes. This page names six of them, all
          on Amazon on 21 November 2026, with the figures each listing and maker actually state,
          what they leave out, and how far each will take you before you need a 60-inch deck.
        </p>

        <section id="top-picks" class="ed-toppicks not-prose">
          <h2>Our top picks:</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best Overall:</span> <a href="#horizon-t101-connect">Horizon T101 Connect</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best Budget:</span> <a href="#sunny-auto-incline-treadmill">Sunny Health & Fitness Auto Incline Treadmill</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[1].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best for Speed Work:</span> <a href="#therun-20-auto-incline">THERUN 20% Auto Incline Treadmill</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[2].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best With iFIT:</span> <a href="#nordictrack-t-6-5-s">NordicTrack T 6.5 S</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[3].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best for Heavier Runners:</span> <a href="#borgusi-20-inch-wide">BORGUSI 20 Inch Wide Folding Treadmill</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[4].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
